  (text "POWER INPUT / +18V4\n- VIN = USB-C VBUS (after the STUSB4500 load switch) OR 12-15 V DC jack, Schottky OR, TVS.\n- U101 LT3757 SEPIC -> +18V4. FBX = +1.6 V x (1 + 105k/10k). RT 41.2k = 300 kHz.\n  Current limit 110 mV / 30 mR = 3.7 A. Feedback is taken before the 1 uH post-filter.\n- VERIFY: LT3757 compensation, FET and inductor choices (simulate in LTspice)."
    (at 20 257 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.524 1.524)
      )
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "fea9c266-7764-5750-a107-1ae43bd459d4")
